            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.21.1+1CH.21.2+1CH.21.3+1CH.21.4+1CH.21.5+1CH.21.6+1CH.21.7+1CH.21.8+1CH.21.9+1CH.21.10+1CH.21.11+1CH.21.12+1CH.21.13+1CH.21.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ke Ch. 21.1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yoabu okhwa Seruya aarakikha khubala babaandu ne se abala amala tawe. Wele aana kumunaanio khu Isiraeli sikila khubala babaandu khuno. Nio bukali bwe babaandu bumaliilisi se baandikwa mu sitabu sie lukano lwe bubwami bwo omwami Daudi tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Babemeelesi be kimiaandu kie bubwami",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
